ssion ends, so call watch_url again after resuming to get a fresh one. Use this when asked to be notified when something external changes (for example, a subscribed artifact is republished). To stop, call unwatch_url with the returned trigger_id.", "eager_input_streaming": true, "input_schema": {"properties": {}, "required": [], "type": "object"}, "name": "mcp__claude-code-remote__watch_url"}, "server": "claude-code-remote"}], "type": "prompt_snapshot"}, "cwd": "/home/user/rainbow-", "entrypoint": "remote_mobile", "gitBranch": "claude/rainbow-restore-env-setup-bxn85h", "isSidechain": true, "parentUuid": "5731ac30-0760-4377-8f77-47e6f82a098c", "sessionId": "c85b9efb-7963-5a97-9c4e-da811e450f6b", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T00:50:44.837Z", "type": "attachment", "userType": "external", "uuid": "d7b74b28-d0a8-492e-84b4-9722cf0fcee4", "version": "2.1.326"}
